---
import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import SupportChat from '../../components/SupportChat';
import {
	LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL,
	LICENSE_PATH,
	PRIVACY_PATH,
	REFUNDS_PATH,
	SITE_BRAND,
	TERMS_PATH,
} from '../../lib/seo';
---

<LegalLayout
	title="Help"
	description="iStockVisual.com help: downloads, attribution, Pro sizes, visual search, and in-browser studio tools."
	heading="Help"
	lede="Short answers for the live library and studio. The assistant below uses the same facts. Refunds and account fixes go by email."
>
	<p>
		For a refund or an account issue, email{' '}
		<a href={`mailto:${LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> from the address on the
		account. Do not paste passwords into chat.
	</p>

	<h2>Library downloads</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>
			<strong>Free:</strong> 512 and 1K (1024 on the long edge), JPG / PNG / WEBP / SVG, no login
			required.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Pro / pass:</strong> 2K, 4K, and 8K while the plan is active. See
			<a href="/price">Pricing</a>.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Fair use:</strong> first 100 HD files per day, then 10 HD per hour. 512 and 1K are
			outside that cap.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Credit:</strong> <strong>Generated by {SITE_BRAND}</strong> — required on every size.
			Copy-ready text is on each asset page. Full rules:
			<a href={LICENSE_PATH}>Content License</a>.
		</li>
		<li>
			The on-page preview watermark is not in your download. The on-page editor can adjust, crop,
			remove background, and (Pro) expand. Free editor exports from library files stay on 512 / 1K.
		</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Studio tools (on your device)</h2>
	<p>These do not upload your files. Start from your disk or from a library download you already have.</p>
	<ul>
		<li><a href="/tools/image">Image Editor</a> — adjust, crop, remove background, expand</li>
		<li><a href="/tools/convert">Image Convert</a> — formats, resize, compress, including HEIC</li>
		<li><a href="/tools/vectorize">Image Vectorizer</a> — bitmap to SVG</li>
		<li><a href="/tools/social">Social Resizer</a> — Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, Facebook, LinkedIn</li>
		<li><a href="/tools/watermark">Batch Watermark</a> — text or logo, scaled to the long edge</li>
		<li><a href="/tools/palette">Palette Generator</a> — swatches, HEX/RGB/HSL, CSS / Tailwind export</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		If the source was Library Content, attribution still applies. Your own photos stay yours.
		Privacy of uploads: <a href={PRIVACY_PATH}>Privacy Policy</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>Visual search</h2>
	<p>
		Drop a photo to find similar library images. The query file is stored about one hour, then
		deleted. It is not added to the catalog.
	</p>

	<h2>Plans and refunds</h2>
	<p>
		6-Month, 12-Month, and Lifetime: 7-day no-questions-asked refund, even after HD downloads.
		1-Month: 3-day trial, refund only if unused. 1-Day and 7-Day: refund only if unused. Details:
		<a href={REFUNDS_PATH}>Refund Policy</a> and <a href={TERMS_PATH}>Terms of Use</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>Ask the assistant</h2>
	<p>
		This chat answers from {SITE_BRAND}’s support brief (license, plans, refunds, tools, privacy).
	</p>
	<div class="support-chat-embed">
		<SupportChat client:load variant="page" />
	</div>
</LegalLayout>
